  <jpcrp030000-asr_E31991-000:NotesOnGuaranteeObligationsToAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: left"&gt;　３　関係会社に対する保証債務&lt;/p&gt;
